{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>\n\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1019/a52370a06d008be.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>吳越分享的視頻顯示，涉事賬號 「花姐」發佈AI偽造帶貨視頻，打着「明星同款、吳越推薦」的旗號推銷某款護膚品，謊稱吳越為回饋粉絲，主動對接廠家給粉絲送福利。</p>\n<p>對此，據澎湃新聞從微信團隊了解到，目前賬號已被永久封禁，內容清空不可見。</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1019/c33da16e5984c6d.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1019/a52370a06d008be.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T05:19:53.826716+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":3,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T05:10:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T10:37:57.712572+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T05:17:34.729938+00:00","content_hash":"436efc6796604545d431985b05bd26e018d3bf22439f9a8e08d1d3c36d7aa090","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}